      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "\n<h2>Etesia–Arniea World Transfer</h2>\n<p>The Actor and Item transfer packs are intentionally empty. Unlock the relevant transfer compendium in the source world, drag selected world documents into it, and then import them in the destination world where this module is enabled.</p>\n<p>Do not treat the transfer packs as authoritative campaign content. They are working containers and may be cleared or replaced between transfers.</p>\n",
        "markdown": ""
